# husky puts `node_modules/.bin` on the PATH and runs this with `sh -e`, so the
# first failure stops the commit.
#
# The linter, the formatter and the type checker sweep the whole repo rather
# than the staged files: it is a handful of files and they finish in
# milliseconds. `bun run test` builds `bin/` first, since the suite runs the
# compiled CLI in a child process. That build is the slow part.
oxlint
oxfmt --check
tsgo -p tsconfig.json
bun run test
